@startuml
' Registracija korisnika - realizacija
' Odgovara slici: registration_sequence_diagram.png

title Registracija korisnika - realizacija (svi alternativni scenariji)

actor "Posetilac" as Visitor
participant "RegisterView\n(register)" as RegisterView
participant "User\nmodel/manager" as User
participant "WalletSignal\n(post_save)" as WalletSignal
participant "Wallet" as Wallet
participant "ArbitratorApplication" as ArbApp

Visitor -> RegisterView : GET /accounts/register/
activate RegisterView
RegisterView --> Visitor : prikaz registracione forme
Visitor -> RegisterView : POST podaci: ime, prezime, username, email,\nlozinka, tip naloga, opcioni CV

note over RegisterView, WalletSignal
Korisnik bira tip naloga: obican korisnik ili arbitrator.
Za arbitratora se ocekuje CV i nalog ostaje neaktivan
do odluke administratora.
end note

alt username je vec zauzet
    RegisterView -> User : User.objects.filter(username).exists()
    activate User
    User --> RegisterView : true
    deactivate User
    RegisterView --> Visitor : greska "Korisnicko ime je vec zauzeto"\n+ prikaz iste forme
else email je vec zauzet
    RegisterView -> User : User.objects.filter(email).exists()
    activate User
    User --> RegisterView : true
    deactivate User
    RegisterView --> Visitor : greska "Email je vec zauzet"\n+ prikaz iste forme
else username i email su slobodni
    RegisterView -> User : create_user(username, email, password,\nrole=USER, is_active=...)
    activate User

    alt izabran obican korisnik
        User -> WalletSignal : post_save(User, created=True)
        activate WalletSignal
        WalletSignal -> Wallet : Wallet.objects.create(user)
        activate Wallet
        Wallet --> WalletSignal : novcanik kreiran
        deactivate Wallet
        WalletSignal --> User : signal zavrsen
        deactivate WalletSignal
        User --> RegisterView : User(role=USER, is_active=True)
        RegisterView --> Visitor : poruka "Nalog je uspesno kreiran"\n+ redirect na login
    else izabran arbitrator
        User -> WalletSignal : post_save(User, created=True)
        activate WalletSignal
        WalletSignal -> Wallet : Wallet.objects.create(user)
        activate Wallet
        Wallet --> WalletSignal : novcanik kreiran
        deactivate Wallet
        WalletSignal --> User : signal zavrsen
        deactivate WalletSignal
        User --> RegisterView : User(role=USER, is_active=False)
        RegisterView -> ArbApp : create(user, cv, status=PENDING)
        activate ArbApp
        ArbApp --> RegisterView : prijava kreirana
        deactivate ArbApp
        RegisterView --> Visitor : poruka "Nalog ceka odobrenje administratora"\n+ redirect na login
    end

    deactivate User
end

note over RegisterView, ArbApp
Posledice: obican korisnik dobija aktivan nalog i novcanik;
arbitrator dobija neaktivan nalog, novcanik i prijavu
sa statusom PENDING.
end note

deactivate RegisterView
@enduml

